  bar. Small enough to read at a glance in a failure message, and long enough
  that a measure RANGE can select a proper subset of it (bars 2-3 are four of
  the eight notes, and no bar shares a pitch with another).

      bar 1: C4 D4   bar 2: E4 F4   bar 3: G4 A4   bar 4: B4 C5
-->
